{
  "name": "GitDesk",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "buildDate": "2026-08-03",
  "channel": "release",
  "organization": "wuyijing-dev",
  "author": "wuyijing",
  "summary": "现代化 Git 可视化工作台 — Material Design 3 · Qt Quick",
  "about": {
    "tagline": "把 Git 变成可操作的软件工程地图",
    "description": "GitDesk 面向开发者的 Git 客户端：分支可视化、Commit 历史、Diff、多仓库工作流，基于 Qt 6 与 Md3 组件库。",
    "highlights": [
      "IDE 风格布局：资源树 · Graph · Changes · History",
      "Pull --rebase、冲突 ours/theirs、Blame、分支对比",
      "Revert / Cherry-pick / Reset Soft·Mixed·Hard、Stash、Tag",
      "中英文；version.json 驱动关于信息；Md3 易用性反馈文档"
    ]
  },
